cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Proposal Agent, please cite it as below."
title: "Proposal Agent: drafting research-proposal sections from PubMed evidence"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Proposal Agent contributors"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open-source web app that drafts the introduction, aims, background and methods of a medical research proposal
  from a study title, with citations to real PubMed records, verified evidence sentences, a sample size computed by
  code and a Word export with right-to-left Persian support.
keywords:
  - research proposal
  - medical education
  - PubMed
  - large language models
  - evidence synthesis
  - Persian
